<div class="draw-open-container">
    <h1>Number draw</h1>
    <p class="toggle-container">
        <label for="colourblind-toggle">Colorblind Mode</label>
        <input type="checkbox" id="colorblind-toggle" role="switch" aria-checked="false">
    </p>
    <img src="/images/draw_wheel.png" alt="non functional image of a number draw wheel" aria-hidden="true">
    <p aria-hidden="true">
        <small>Placeholder wheel, not functional at the moment</small>
    </p>
    <h2>How to play</h2>
    <p>Select available numbers to enter the draw. You may reserve as many numbers as you want, but each number can only be reserved by one player.</p>
    <p aria-hidden="true">Meanings of each button color: Yellow - Open, Green - Reserved by you, Red - Taken by another player</p>

    {{!-- Container for generated guess button elements --}}
    <div id="guess-buttons"></div>
</div>